  "description": "The GeekVape Aegis Solo 3 Mod (External Battery) is a powerful and versatile mod designed for vapers who demand performance and flexibility. Powered by a single external 18650 battery (sold separately) , the Aegis Solo 3 Mod delivers up to 100W of power, making it suitable for a range of vaping styles, from sub-ohm vaping to mouth-to-lung. Constructed with IP68-rated tri-proof technology, the Aegis Solo 3 Mod is designed to withstand the elements, offering protection from water, dust, and shock. Whether you’re out exploring or working in harsh conditions, this mod is designed to endure. Its compact and ergonomic design ensures it fits comfortably in your hand and is easy to carry around. The mod features a 0.96” colour display that shows vital information such as wattage, battery life, and coil resistance, and offers multiple vaping modes, including SMART, POWER, BOOSTING, MEMORY, ECO, and TCR. These modes allow vapers to tailor their experience according to their preferences, making the mod highly versatile. The USB Type-C fast charging ensures that your external 18650 battery charges quickly, allowing for minimal downtime. With compatibility for a wide range of tanks and atomisers, the Aegis Solo 3 Mod offers an outstanding all-around vaping experience. Also available in a built-in 3000mAh battery version",
